          "id": 1794643041,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@johnthacker Thank you for helping in keeping the packaging in sync. Switching to Qt6 would prevent building the package on older Debian/Ubuntu releases, thus `debian/control` is now generated from `debian/control.in` (I need to add a warning to `debian/control`) . This should also be synced.",
